between observers in the field, who may come back with sparse data 
taken under pristine conditions, and zoo workers, whose data are 
copious but refer to animal societies under serious constraint; between 
strict geneticists of human behavior and subtle cultural 
anthropologists; even between NATO and the Warsaw Pact.

